      "content": "Take an extra unit of rapid-acting insulin, but also drink a glass of water and eat a small snack with some carbs to prevent hypoglycemia. If you feel shaky, you can take a piece of fruit or a few crackers. Remember, I'm here to help you feel better, so don't hesitate to reach out if you need more advice. Stay strong, and keep an eye on your sugar levels.",
